 of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10040","city":"CS1052","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[54,54,78,77,96,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1011602","helmet":"WP1013002","treasure":"WP28014","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1000408","name":{"zh":"小乔完婚","en":"Xiao Qiao's Wedding"},"year":"199","month":"12","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1000212","name":{"zh":"并蒂双姝","en":"Twin Blossoms"},"year":"198","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"孙策率军进入庐江，结识乔老，但美若天仙的二乔，却因即将到来婚事苦恼…\n\n禁忌条件：主角为孙策，周瑜时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【主角为男性】，【身属孙策势力（信义契约身份无效）】，【庐江属孙策】，【与孙策的关系等级至少为2级且不足5级】，【与周瑜的关系等级不足5级】，【与大乔小乔的关系等级不足2级】，【大乔与小乔未拥有配偶】\n\n逆天改命：【代替周瑜娶小乔，或同时迎娶大小乔】","en":"Sun Ce leads his army into Lujiang and becomes acquainted with Elder Qiao, yet the peerless Two Qiaos are distressed over their impending marriages...\n\n\n\nRestrictions: Cannot trigger if protagonist is Sun Ce or Zhou Yu.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Protagonist is male】, 【Belong to Sun Ce's Faction (Pact of Faith status is invalid)】, 【Lujiang belongs to Sun Ce】, 【Relationship level with Sun Ce is at least Level 2 and below Level 5】, 【Relationship level with Zhou Yu is below Level 5】, 【Relationship level with Da Qiao and Xiao Qiao is below Level 2】, 【Da Qiao and Xiao Qiao have no Spouse】\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【Marry Xiao Qiao in place of Zhou Yu, or marry both Da Qiao and Xiao Qiao】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"乔国老二女儿，与其姐姐大乔并称二乔，二人以绝世美女之名广为流传。皖城被孙策周瑜攻取时，乔国老分别许配大乔、小乔与孙策、周瑜。赤壁之战前，听诸葛亮说到曹操此行目的有将二乔囚于铜雀台供其享乐，周瑜大怒，决心与曹操一决死战。","tc":"喬國老二女兒，與其姐姐大喬并稱二喬，二人以絕世美女之名廣為流傳。皖城被孫策周瑜攻取時，喬國老分別許配大喬、小喬與孫策、周瑜。赤壁之戰前，聽諸葛亮說到曹操此行目的有將二喬囚于銅雀臺供其享樂，周瑜大怒，決心與曹操一決死戰。","en":"The younger daughter of Lord Qiao, known together with her elder sister Da Qiao as the Two Qiaos—famed throughout the land for their peerless beauty. When Sun Ce and Zhou Yu captured Wan, Lord Qiao betrothed Da Qiao to Sun Ce and Xiao Qiao to Zhou Yu. Before the Battle of Red Cliffs, upon hearing Zhuge Liang claim that Cao Cao's purpose was to imprison the Two Qiaos in the Bronze Sparrow Terrace for his pleasure, Zhou Yu flew into a rage and resolved to fight Cao Cao to the death.","jp":"喬国老の次女。姉の大喬とともに「二喬」と称され、絶世の美女として広く知れ渡っていた。皖城が孫策と周瑜によって攻め落とされた際、喬国老は大喬を孫策に、小喬を周瑜にそれぞれ嫁がせた。赤壁の戦いの前、諸葛亮から曹操の目的の一つが二喬を銅雀台に囲って享楽することにあると聞かされた周瑜は激怒し、曹操との一決死戦を決意した。","kr":"교국로의 차녀로, 언니 대교와 함께 '이교'라 불렸으며 두 사람 모두 절세미녀로 널리 이름을 떨쳤다. 손책과 주유가 완성을 함락했을 때 교국로는 대교와 소교를 각각 손책과 주유에게 시집보냈다. 적벽대전을 앞두고 제갈량에게서 조조의 남정 목적 중 하나가 이교를 동작대에 가두어 향락을 누리려는 것이라는 말을 들은 주유는 크게 격노하여 조조와 결전을 벌이기로 결심했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10024","remark":"","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"小乔","nameTc":"小喬","nameEn":"Xiao Qiao","nameJp":"小喬","nameKr":"소교","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"小乔","power":"WJ10038","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"199","city":"CS1053","gender":"1","rule":"54","force":"54","wise":"78","politics":"77","charm":"96","will":"65","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"15","willTalent":"12","weaponMaster":"19/19/70/19/19/35/90/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1001105;1004302","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000302","battleSoul":"1009305","debateSoul":"1001505","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"6400","strategy":"1001505","strategy2":"1008701","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/3/1/4/2/2/1/2/2/5/1/4/2/2/1/4/3/2/4/3","attribute2":"62/67/84/82/96/72","morality":"7","compatible":"83","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"183","show":"195","d